      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "衝撃に備えろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "総員、散開せよ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "クソッ、規模が大きすぎる！　何もかも破壊し尽くさんばかりの勢いだ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "このままではまずいぞ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "急いで退避するんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "は、はい……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "ッ来るぞ、踏ん張れ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ひっ……！　あ、ぁ……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "空が……空が、落ちてくる……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ぐっ……！　い……痛い……身体が、痛い……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "手が……俺の手がない！　う、あああっ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "は、はは……どうして……どうしてこんなことに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "い、嫌だ、死にたくない、死にたく……あああああああっ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "っ、重装オペレーター！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "術師の保護に回れ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――！？　なっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "一体何の音だ……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "隕石だ、かなりデカい――クソッ、通り沿いに落ちた！　伏せろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "きゃっ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！　建物が、倒れて――！　危ない！　そこを離れてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "こっちだ、早く！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "――あっ……！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "いたっ……ド、ドクター……？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "つ、突き飛ばして逃がしてくれたのか！？　……だけど、それじゃドクターが――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "――ッ、危ない！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "……えっ？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "待っ……ニアールさん、無茶です！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "――伏せろ、ドクター！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "……っ、はあ……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "間に合ったようだな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "……！　生きてる！　よかった、二人とも生きてるぞ！！　さすがニアールさん……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "……ふぅ、はぁっ……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ニアールさん！　ドクター！　早くこちらへ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "私は大丈夫だ！　先に行け、ドクター！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "この盾は、まだ持ちこたえられる！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "だから跳ぶんだ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "ためらうな、早く！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "ドクター……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "だ、大丈夫ですか？　お怪我はありませんか？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "大丈夫。このくらい、大したことじゃない。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "ああ。ニアールに感謝しないとな。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "……あなたという人は……もうあんな真似はしないでくれ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "仮に無茶をするにしても、まず私に声をかけてもらえねば、守れるものも守れなくなってしまうだろう？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "もとより、どのような状況でも、あなたが傷付くことなど容認できないが――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ニアール",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "私の目の前でとなれば、なおのこと見過ごせない。……どうか、そのことを理解しておいてほしい。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……とにかく今は、みなさんが無事でよかったです……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……ただ……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（あとどれだけ持ちこたえられるのか……）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（本当に、生き延びることができるのか……どうにも、不安は尽きないけれど……）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……はぁ……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "……？　なんだか、降ってくる隕石が減ったような……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "天災の第一波は越えた、ということでしょうか……？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "……まだ、気を抜くわけにはいかん。この天災がどれだけ続くかは未知数だからな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "とはいえ……天災の中心からは抜け出せたと見ていいだろう。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "ひとまず、乗り切ったようだな。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "はい……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "みなさん、動けそうですか？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "はい！　オペレーター全員、大きな問題はありません！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "一部怪我人もいますが、いずれも軽傷です！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "……俺たち……生き延びたんですね……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "ア……う、ぁあ……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "レユニオンにも、無事な人が――"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "……お前……ら……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "ぁ……ああああっ！！　ロドス……ロドスの奴らだ……！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "……ッ、なんだ……？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "アァ……ぁ……う、アアアアアア！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "まさか、まだ戦うつもりなんでしょうか……！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "……ロドス……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "……殺せ……ロドスを殺せ！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "チッ、こいつら……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
